        "Content": "Leonard Wislon keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you \r\n\r\n2 Bedroom, 2 Bathroom Ground Floor Apartment \r\nParking \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to  prescent Apartment 79 Summereseat to the Dublin 15 property market \r\n\r\nApartment 79 Summerseat Avenue is a superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment, ideally located within the highly desirable Summerseat development in Clonee, Dublin 15. This well-proportioned property offers bright, spacious and comfortable accommodation throughout, together with a private outdoor area and the added convenience of being within easy reach of a host of local amenities and excellent transport links.\r\nOn arrival, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming entrance hallway, with windows overlooking the attractive central courtyard, creating a pleasant first impression and allowing natural light to flow into the property. From the hallway, you are led to the first double bedroom, which is bright and airy and benefits from two windows, allowing plenty of natural light into the room. Continuing through the apartment is the second generous double bedroom, which also benefits from two windows and is further enhanced by its own ensuite shower room, making it an ideal principal bedroom.\r\n\r\nThe hallway also provides useful additional storage before leading to the large family bathroom. The bathroom is well presented and fitted with quality sanitary ware, providing excellent facilities for both residents and guests.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the property is the spacious open-plan living and dining area, creating a wonderful setting for both everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen is positioned to the right and offers an excellent range of both base and eye-level storage units, providing ample storage and workspace. The kitchen opens directly into the dining and living area, allowing the space to feel bright, open and sociable. From the living room, there is access to the property's private outdoor space, offering a lovely additional area to enjoy during the warmer months and a welcome extension to the internal accommodation.\r\n\r\nSummerseat Avenue is situated in a highly desirable and convenient location within Dublin 15, close to Clonee Village and a wide variety of amenities. Residents are within easy reach of local shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and everyday services, with Lidl and Aldi both conveniently located nearby. For those looking for a more extensive shopping experience, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre is only a short drive away and offers an extensive selection of high-street and independent retailers, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and services.\r\n\r\nThe location is particularly attractive to commuters, with excellent access to the M3 and M50 motorway networks, providing convenient connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. Dublin Airport is also readily accessible by car. Public transport is well catered for, with local bus services including Routes 70 and 270 providing connections towards Dublin and surrounding areas, while Dunboyne railway station is also within easy reach and provides commuter rail services towards Dublin.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by a selection of primary and secondary schools, making the location particularly appealing to families. Nearby schools include Scoil Ghrainne Community National School, Mary Mother of Hope Junior and Senior National Schools, Castaheany Educate Together and St Benedict's National School, while secondary school options include Coláiste Pobail Setanta, Hansfield Educate Together Secondary School, Hartstown Community School, St Peter's College and Blakestown Community School. The surrounding area also offers a wide variety of sporting, recreational and community facilities, adding further to the appeal of this established residential location.\r\n\r\nOverall, Apartment 79 Summerseat Avenue offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a bright and spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground floor apartment in a highly desirable Dublin 15 location. With two generous double bedrooms, an ensuite, a large family bathroom, excellent storage, a well-appointed kitchen, spacious open-plan living and dining accommodation and private outdoor space, this property provides an ideal home for first-time buyers, downsizers, investors or those seeking a well-connected property close to a wealth of amenities.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the excellent space, layout and convenient location this property has to offer.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
